WEBVTT

00:27:58.706 --> 00:28:01.639
But what I will tell them, and I
can absolutely guarantee you,

00:28:01.663 --> 00:28:04.779
is that you will be a different
human being at the other end of it

00:28:04.803 --> 00:28:06.300
than you were at the beginning.

00:28:06.324 --> 00:28:08.056
The process of having made something

00:28:08.080 --> 00:28:10.340
will transform you in ways
that I cannot predict

00:28:10.364 --> 00:28:11.517
and you cannot imagine.

00:28:11.541 --> 00:28:14.118
It is so interesting to find out
who you're going to be

00:28:14.142 --> 00:28:15.385
on the other side of that,

00:28:15.409 --> 00:28:16.652
that that's why you do it.

00:28:16.676 --> 00:28:18.982
And then if you get subsidiary reward,

00:28:19.006 --> 00:28:22.158
if you should be lucky enough
to be paid for it another way,

00:28:22.182 --> 00:28:23.365
then great.

00:28:23.389 --> 00:28:24.885
I just went through this again.

00:28:24.909 --> 00:28:26.581
I just lived this experience again.

00:28:26.605 --> 00:28:30.423
And I thought, "Why does this surprise me,
when I'm constantly preaching this?"